  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF9y t\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0110inh"
    Lines:
    - "C\xE1nh tr\xE1i \u0110inh ch\xF9ng v\xEC m\u1EA5t ba m\u0169i gi\xE1o. Li\u1EC5n
      gi\u1EADt c\u1EDD, th\xFAc \u0111\u1ED9i k\u1EF5 d\u1EF1 b\u1ECB \u0111\xE1nh
      xi\xEAn v\xE0o m\u0169i Ki\u1EC1u, c\u1EAFt chu\u1ED7i thay \u0111\u1ED9i c\u1EE7a
      \u0111\u1ECBch. N\u1ECF tuy\u1EBFn hai b\u1EAFn m\u01B0a ngang t\u1EA7m h\xF4ng
      ng\u1EF1a. Xe m\u1ED9c h\u1EB9p l\u0103n l\xEAn che kho\u1EA3ng h\u1EDF, \u0111\xF3ng
      c\u1ECDc ng\u1EAFn d\u01B0\u1EDBi b\xF9n \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt ch\xE2n v\xF3.
      T\xEAn d\u1EA7u c\u1EE7a Ki\u1EC1u b\xE9n l\u1EEDa tr\xEAn khi\xEAn kh\xF4,
      l\xEDnh h\u1EA5t khi\xEAn v\xE0o b\xF9n d\u1EADp t\u1EAFt r\u1ED3i nh\u1EB7t
      gi\xE1o kh\xE1c."
